{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/floatingpoint\/significand"]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/FloatingPoint"]]},"metadata":{"platforms":[{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","name":"iOS"},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","name":"iPadOS"},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","name":"Mac Catalyst"},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"10.10","name":"macOS"},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"9.0","name":"tvOS"},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS"},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"2.0","name":"watchOS"}],"externalID":"s:SF11significandxvp","title":"significand","roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","required":true,"modules":[{"name":"Swift"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"significand","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"abstract":[{"text":"The significand of the floating-point value.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/FloatingPoint\/significand"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"significand","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The magnitude of a floating-point value ","type":"text"},{"code":"x","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of type ","type":"text"},{"code":"F","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" can be calculated","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by using the following formula, where ","type":"text"},{"code":"**","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is exponentiation:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["x.significand * (F.radix ** x.exponent)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In the next example, ","type":"text"},{"code":"y","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has a value of ","type":"text"},{"code":"21.5","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which is encoded as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"1.34375 * 2 ** 4","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The significand of ","type":"text"},{"code":"y","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is therefore 1.34375.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let y: Double = 21.5","\/\/ y.significand == 1.34375","\/\/ y.exponent == 4","\/\/ Double.radix == 2"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If a type’s radix is 2, then for finite nonzero numbers, the significand","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is in the range ","type":"text"},{"code":"1.0 ..< 2.0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". For other values of ","type":"text"},{"code":"x","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"x.significand","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is defined as follows:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"x"},{"text":" is zero, then ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"x.significand"},{"text":" is 0.0.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"x"},{"text":" is infinite, then ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"x.significand"},{"text":" is infinity.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"x"},{"text":" is NaN, then ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"x.significand"},{"text":" is NaN.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The significand is frequently also called the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"mantissa","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", but","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"significand is the preferred terminology in the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"http:\/\/ieeexplore.ieee.org\/servlet\/opac?punumber=4610933","type":"reference"},{"text":", to allay confusion with the use of mantissa for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the fractional part of a logarithm.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift":{"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","title":"Swift","url":"\/documentation\/swift","abstract":[{"text":"Build apps using a powerful open language.","type":"text"}],"images":[{"identifier":"Swift-PageImage-card.png","type":"card"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/FloatingPoint/significand":{"url":"\/documentation\/swift\/floatingpoint\/significand","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The significand of the floating-point value."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"significand","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/FloatingPoint\/significand","required":true,"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"significand"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"}]},"Swift-PageImage-card.png":{"alt